 "tutorial_lines": [
  "Seven hours to dawn. The dead march on the door. Hodor holds it; you build the towers that stop them.",
  "A Watchtower already stands by the door. Tap the ⚔ banner at the top of the road, call the first wave, and count the knocks.",
  "",
  "Gold builds towers. Tap the glowing stone ring and raise a second Watchtower. The clock is running.",
  "Your champion rides up from the keep. Tap the ground where they should stand.",
  "The framed card is your champion; the skill beside it is theirs alone: {SKILL}. Tap it before the dark closes in.",
  "",
  "Towers grow with gold. Tap your Watchtower, then ⬆ and ✓. Faster. Dawn will not wait.",
  "Another knock is coming. Tap the ⚔ banner and call the second wave.",
  "Your house's spells wait on the right. Arrow rain is a volley from the wall: tap it, then tap the dead on the road.",
  "A spell needs time to return: the dark cover drains away while it recharges. Your champion's skill works the same way.",
  "Tap the ⚔ banner for the last wave. Seven hours, one door. Hold it!",
  "That is all I can teach you. Hold the gate, and listen for the knock."
